|obj-001_explicit_seed-engine_separation
  |priority=CRITICAL
  |solves=LESSON-001
  |objective
    |what_this_means
      |seed_contains=Reasoning DNA (principles, models, foundations)
      |engine_contains=Methodology implementation (pipeline, rules, processes)
      |seed_never_contains=Engine-specific implementation
      |engine_must_reference=Compatible Seed(s)
      |implementation
        |items
          ||Clear ownership in document headers
          ||Explicit "Seed contains" vs "Engine contains" sections
          ||Compatibility declarations in Engine metadata
        |evidence_of_success
          |items
            ||Can identify any content as Seed-owned or Engine-owned
            ||No ambiguity about what belongs where
            ||Clear dependency chain: Seed → Engine → Laboratory
      |obj-002_boundary-first_architecture
        |priority=HIGH
        |solves=LESSON-002, LESSON-007
        |objective
          |what_this_means
            |boundary_definition_first=Define what belongs where BEFORE implementation
            |one_owner_per_component=No shared ownership
            |explicit_interfaces=Components communicate through defined interfaces only
            |no_cross-ownership=Engine owns methodology; Seed owns reasoning; etc.
            |implementation
              |items
                ||BOUNDARIES.md section in every seed
                ||Interface definitions between components
                ||Ownership matrix documenting who owns what
              |evidence_of_success
                |items
                  ||Can trace any decision to one owner
                  ||No overlapping responsibilities
                  ||Changes only affect owned components
            |obj-003_migration-first_evolution
              |priority=HIGH
              |solves=LESSON-003
              |objective
                |what_this_means
                  |migration_documents=Every structural change has a MIGRATION-XXX.md
                  |rollback_path=Each migration defines how to revert
                  |compatibility_matrix=What works with what
                  |gradual_transitions=Old and new can coexist
                  |implementation
                    |items
                      ||Migration template and guidelines
                      ||Compatibility documentation standards
                      ||Version coordination process
                    |evidence_of_success
                      |items
                        ||Structural changes are planned, not reactive
                        ||Can always determine migration state
                        ||No surprise breaking changes
                  |obj-004_seed_lineage_documentation
                    |priority=HIGH
                    |solves=LESSON-004, LESSON-006
                    |objective
                      |what_this_means
                        |parent_reference=Each Seed references its parent
                        |change_log=What changed from parent and why
                        |inheritance_map=What was inherited unchanged
                        |preservation=Old Seeds remain readable and understandable
                        |implementation
                          |items
                            ||PARENT-CHILD.md in every seed
                            ||Provenance section in seed.yaml
                            ||Change rationale documentation
                          |evidence_of_success
                            |items
                              ||Can understand why any decision was made
                              ||Can trace evolution of reasoning
                              ||Historical seeds are self-documenting
                        |obj-005_single_responsibility_enforcement
                          |priority=MEDIUM
                          |solves=LESSON-005
                          |objective
                            |what_this_means
                              |document_purpose=Every document has one clear purpose
                              |no_mixed_content=Principles don't contain methodology
                              |clear_ownership=One component owns each artifact
                              |reference_over_copy=Reuse rather than duplicate
                              |implementation
                                |items
                                  ||Document purpose declarations
                                  ||Cross-reference rather than copy content
                                  ||Ownership annotations
                                |evidence_of_success
                                  |items
                                    ||Each document has one reason to exist
                                    ||No duplicate content
                                    ||Clear responsibility assignment
                              |obj-006_experiment_standards
                                |priority=MEDIUM
                                |solves=LESSON-008
                                |objective
