                                    |mandatory_fields=TRACKER.md, evidence/, runs/, etc.
                                    |template_enforcement=Use provided templates
                                    |quality_gates=Standards are part of validation
                                    |implementation
                                      |items
                                        ||Experiment template in seed
                                        ||Required document structure
                                        ||Quality checklist
                                      |evidence_of_success
                                        |items
                                          ||All experiments have consistent structure
                                          ||Easy to compare experiments
                                          ||Reproducibility improved
